	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"カスタマイズの幅を広げる30MMのエグザビークルシリーズ「アタックサブマリンVer.」に水中戦をイメージした新色が登場！",
			"• カラーはブルーグレー。",
			"• パーツの組み替えでエイ型、ノコギリザメ型、シュモクザメ型の３形態に変形。",
			"• 各機体のバックパックとしても使用可能。",
			"• 分解すればカスタマイズパーツとしても使える。"
		],
		"en": [
			"A new color inspired by underwater warfare is now available in the 30MM EXA Vehicle Series \"Attack Submarine Ver.\" that expands the range of customization!",
			"• Color is blue-gray.",
			"• By rearranging parts, it can be transformed into three forms: stingray, saw shark, and hammerhead shark.",
			"• Can also be used as a backpack for each aircraft.",
			"• It can be used as customized parts by disassembling it."
		]
